  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/altsem/gitu/zipball/v0.44.0",
  "body": "## [0.44.0] - 2026-10-28\n\n### 🚀 Features\n\n- Pretty print top level errors (#553)\n- *(log)* Commit trees + local/all branches + all refs\n- *(config)* `general.wrap_lines` to cut long lines off instead of wrapping\n- *(cli)* Add completion subcommand for shell completion scripts (#555)\n- Search via `/`, `n` and `N`, backwards search (vim '?') still bound to help menu by default\n- *(log)* Show author and date for each commit\n- Port over config from Ratatui\n- Remove Ratatui dep. Rendering is now simpler, no double-buffering and diffing.\n- Word-wrapping\n\n### 🐛 Bug Fixes\n\n- *(ui)* Clip printed spans to the width the layout gave them\n- Copy to clipboard on wayland (enable arboard's \"wayland-data-control\" feature)\n- Calculate display width with unicode-width to handle emoji\n\n### 🔧 Configuration\n\n- *(log)* New general.log_author_width option (default 15)\n\n### ⚡ Performance\n\n- *(screen)* Scroll relative to items instead counting lines from the top\n- *(screen)* Lazy compute layout as view is navigated down\n\n",
